tion to the patient's chart and choose wisely \u2014 you can only equip one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you play it safe, or will you risk using a more potent but dangerous Overclock?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861240/extras/d959a404c439359c6c7baef5447be4d8.avif?t=1754419400\" alt=\"Perfect your operating skills\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving patients is just the beginning. Each of your performances <i>will</i> be evaluated.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score points for skilled execution, earn bonuses by fulfilling Directives, and maximize your rank with time points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on challenging CyberDoc evaluations, and compare your skills with your friends and the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861240/extras/9e1cecfec5af4e4a57b76eb5df1ee0e7.avif?t=1754419400\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Wizbird Games LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3639510","name":"Cutting Edge: Roots Of Mutation"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861240/04d7be1707560361efa27c3a1d4b9cd5be42c09d/header.jpg?t=1754419400","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Cutting Edge: Roots Of Mutation\u2122 by Wizbird Games LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257165516,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165516/movie480.mp4?t=1754419333","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165516/movie_max.mp4?t=1754419333"},"name":"Prerelease Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst